    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tgpr](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tgpr) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 46.281 depth occurred on Jul 29 2026 48km E of Prieto Diaz. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 13.1384 longitude 124.6138. It impacted 16811 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
